  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4301 alignleft\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/the_drake_law_firm_p.c._releases_free_no_drama_divorce_guide-212x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"308\" height=\"435\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/the_drake_law_firm_p.c._releases_free_no_drama_divorce_guide-212x300.jpg 212w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/the_drake_law_firm_p.c._releases_free_no_drama_divorce_guide-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/the_drake_law_firm_p.c._releases_free_no_drama_divorce_guide-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/the_drake_law_firm_p.c._releases_free_no_drama_divorce_guide-1086x1536.jpg 1086w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/the_drake_law_firm_p.c._releases_free_no_drama_divorce_guide-1448x2048.jpg 1448w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/the_drake_law_firm_p.c._releases_free_no_drama_divorce_guide.jpg 1587w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 308px) 100vw, 308px\" />GOLDEN, Colorado – Divorce Attorney Marie Drake of <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com\">The Drake Law Firm, P.C</a>. is pleased to announce the release of a FREE guide to with bullet points that will assist people contemplating divorce in having a cooperative, no drama divorce, rather than a high conflict and costly divorce.. The “Five Things to Consider for a No Drama Divorce” guide is available for download on the <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/no-drama-divorce/\">website</a> and is designed to offer constructive advice and steps to take to keep the divorce process from becoming a drama-filled experience.</p>\n<p>&#8220;When someone realizes they need to get a divorce from someone they thought was their soulmate, there&#8217;s already a lot of emotion and pain involved. This guide was created as a resource for people who simply want to move on with their lives without the drama that divorce often brings. In the guide, I give people five things to think about, and if followed, it will help them have a cooperative, no drama divorce. We specialize in no drama divorces at The Drake Law Firm. However, if it comes down to a fight, you won&#8217;t have a better ally than our firm,&#8221; Drake says. &#8220;I encourage anyone thinking about divorce but hesitating because they don&#8217;t want the drama that usually comes with it to download the <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/no-drama-divorce/\">No Drama Divorce Guide</a> today, and then call us at <a href=\"tel:303-261-8111\">(303) 261-8111</a> for assistance with your cooperative, no drama divorce.&#8221;</p>\n<p>Download your FREE No Drama Divorce Guide by going <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/no-drama-divorce/\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>For more information, visit <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com\">https://thedrakelawfirm.com</a> or <a href=\"https://www.thenodramadivorce.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.thenodramadivorce.com</a>.</p>\n<h2>About The Drake Law Firm</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com\">The Drake Law Firm, P.C.</a> is a full-service law firm that focuses on family law, business law, and real estate. While some disputes require litigation, we are also successful at achieving our clients&#8217; goals before trial through settlement. At The Drake Law Firm, P.C., we believe in listening to our clients and helping them meet their goals. We proudly serve Colorado and the Rocky Mountain region.</p>\n<p>To schedule your consultation, call <a href=\"tel:303-261-8111\">(303) 261-8111</a> or fill out our <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">contact us</a> form.</p>\n<h2>Distribution Links:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/104660/817205\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/104660/817205</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.